# Verify the help overlay lists the source-filter stops.
#
# History (file name kept for git history):
#   Original: 5 stops — `all → claude → codex → ecs → managed → all`.
#   2026-07-10: tattle-qwe renamed to ecs.
#   Later: cycle restricted to `all → claude → codex → all` —
#     ecs/managed are skipped in the `>` / `<` handlers because
#     including them showed a misleading "0/N — no Claude sessions"
#     empty state (see src/tui/handlers/pane.rs `Char('>')`).
# So the current expectation is claude + codex only.

write placeholder.txt x
open placeholder.txt

command ai.dashboard

# Open help overlay.
key ?
# The help row is `> / < : cycle source filter (all → claude → codex → all)`.
expect screen contains "claude"
expect screen contains "codex"

# Close help.
key ?
expect screen lacks "Claude Agents — help"
